msgid ""
"Notice that fewer actions are shown in this new graph. This is because the "
"graph above only shows actions that play some role in the force calculation."
msgstr ""

#: Graphs.md:82
msgid ""
"I have found these diagrammatic representations of PLUMED input files "
"enormously beneficial when dealing with complicated PLUMED input files. I "
"will thus use them extensively in these notes about the work that I have "
"done in refining PLUMED."
msgstr ""
